        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Wandering Chef Dedication</p><hr /><p>You have spent enough time in a kitchen to know which tools make good weapons. You become trained in the chef's knife, cleaver, tenderizer, skewer, rolling pin, and frying pan. Whenever you gain a class feature that grants you expert or higher proficiency in simple weapons, you also gain that rank in these weapons.</p><p>Once your proficiency rank in one of these weapons is expert or higher, you gain access to its critical specialization effect.</p><hr /><p><strong>Source</strong> Marquiste Additions</p>"
